---
const links = [
  { label: "About", href: "/company/about" },
  { label: "Jonny Bowker", href: "/company/jonny-bowker" },
  { label: "Fractional Chief AI Officer", href: "/company/interim-ai-directorship" },
  { label: "Security", href: "/company/security" },
  { label: "Contact", href: "/company/contact" },
  { label: "RSS Feeds", href: "/rss" },
  { label: "Privacy", href: "/legal/privacy" },
  { label: "Terms", href: "/legal/terms" },
];
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-slate text-paper">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-slate" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="container-wide relative z-10 py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[980px]">
      <img
        src="/images/infrastructure/logo.svg"
        alt="Advanced Analytica"
        loading="lazy"
        class="mx-auto h-10 w-auto opacity-100 md:h-12"
      />

      <div
        class="mt-10 grid gap-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-paper/85 md:text-lg"
      >
        <p>
          Most businesses are sitting on information they can’t use at speed.
          The people who hold it are busy, and when they leave, the knowledge
          goes with them. The documents are static, and the processes around
          them weren’t designed for AI.
        </p>
        <p>
          Advanced Analytica works with these businesses to turn that information
          into structured data assets. Once they're integrated, AI systems can
          govern it, and the business can use it. We bring in the strategy, the
          specification and the AI skills to rework how the business operates.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center eyebrow mb-5 mb-10 font-bold">
          MOVE FAST. STAY SAFE.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="border-t border-paper/10 bg-ink text-paper">
  <div class="container-wide flex flex-col gap-6 py-10 text-sm text-paper/70">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-8">
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-paper">
          Advanced Analytica
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6">
          <div class="mb-3 text-[0.65rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-paper/55">
            Accreditations
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
            <a
              href="https://www.scottishlegal.com/articles/legal-tech-expert-awarded-law-society-of-scotland-accredited-legal-technologist-status"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="block w-full max-w-[180px] overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-paper/20 bg-white text-ink transition-colors hover:border-paper/50"
              aria-label="Jonathan Bowker, Accredited Legal Technologist, Law Society of Scotland — view accreditation announcement"
            >
              <img
                src="https://fantasticlawyers.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/Law-Society-Scotland-LS_Accredited-Legal-Technologist-360x360.png"
                width="360"
                height="360"
                loading="lazy"
                alt="Law Society of Scotland Accredited Legal Technologist badge"
                class="block h-auto w-full"
              />
              <span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-ink/10 px-4 py-3">
                <span class="text-[0.7rem] font-semibold leading-relaxed">
                  Jonathan Bowker · Accredited Legal Technologist
                </span>
                <span class="text-ink/45" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
              </span>
            </a>
            <iframe
              src="https://registry.blockmarktech.com/certificates/2a565b13-9ba9-4641-9027-7f115417dfc7/widget/?tooltip_position=bottom&amp;theme=transparent"
              width="132"
              height="132"
              loading="lazy"
              title="Cyber Essentials certificate for Advanced Analytica Limited, verified by BlockMark"
              referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
              class="shrink-0 border-0"
            ></iframe>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        {
          links.map((item) => (
            <a href={item.href} class="hover:text-paper transition-colors">
              {item.label}
            </a>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="text-xs">© {new Date().getFullYear()} Advanced Analytica.</div>
  </div>
</footer>
